{
  "_comment": "ABCLearning (kids shell) screenshot capture: 11 distinct real-use activity states (tracing, letter cards, the three letter games), each a different letter or round seed and a cycled theme (sunny / meadow / bedtime). No home menu, sticker book, parent area, gate or reveal popup in any slot. _setup_taps unlocks full_pack (so K-Z + all games are reachable and no banner), mutes the voice for capture, and seeds some traced letters. Screens are opened with KIDS.go(screen, params); trace prog {s: finished strokes, f: fraction of the next} shows a stroke mid-trace; play seed fixes the round.",
